      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The Moonlit King casts one of the following spells, requiring no material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (save DC 19):<br>At will: continual flame, invisibility (self only), moonbeam, zone of truth<br>3/day each: dispel evil and good, dispel magic, major image<br>1/day each: heal, project image"
      ]
