      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The Moonlit King teleports, along with any equipment he is wearing or carrying, up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space he can see. The origin and destination spaces must contain moonlight."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shadow Slip",
      "category": "reaction",
